从防护栏中冲出。‘轰’那防护林被冲出几米之外，迷彩轿车急速的前进，朝着山林之中直奔。“蓝小姐，七号直升飞机朝着这边靠近了。”迷彩轿车之中，一位男子伸出脑袋看看了上空的直升飞机，回身立马朝着后方的女子说道。“从深林之中绕过去。”女子透过车窗朝着上方看了一眼，满眼的恨意流露出来。“是。”前方驾驶的男子闻言，立马加大速度，左手在油门的部位一按，整个迷彩轿车，立马发生的变化。迷彩车，外围增加了一层刀子一般的亮片，奔跑的车轱辘立马变得大上一轮，密林之中速度更加的快和稳。后方的女子，全身穿着黑色皮革，带着黑色墨镜，手中拿着一份资料袋，手指握着资料袋稍稍紧了紧，抿着的红唇不由得也绷紧了几分。在这份资料传到她手中的那一刻，她便知道该如何去做，也许从今天开始，这个世界上再也不会有银月家族的存在……银月家族有着几千年的历史，世代是医者，医术超群，全国没有任何一个医者能比的上，但他们这个家族却很少救人，反而会害人！“十一号迷彩车，请急速停车，请急速停车。”上空直升飞机转眼便到了迷彩车的头顶，巨大风力冲击着下方奔跑的迷彩车。车上驾驶的男子，急速转弯，想绕道隐秘之处，试图脱离直升飞机。但上方飞机缓缓下降，倒是有一种，他们再不停车，飞机便会压在她们车上的架势。“蓝小姐，现在该怎么办？”男子脸上露出紧张之色。“停车。”女子摘掉黑色的墨镜，露出一双锐利的眼眸。巴掌大的小脸，配上如此一双眼睛，美艳的让人不敢直视。车门打开，女子下车，抬头看着上空直升飞机落下来的人影，冰冷的脸上闪过一丝光芒，左手手中的资料袋被她紧紧握着，右手一枚打火机在手心之中隐藏。“蓝雅放下你手中的资料，或许你还能活。”上空下来的男子，口气带着劝说。“能活？”蓝雅一笑，仿佛听到了最好笑的语言：“可，我从来都没想过要活。”她的一条命换取整个银月家族值了！“蓝雅，你别忘记你的身份！”男子闻言似乎有些着急了，眼神盯着那手中的资料袋，握紧拳头。蓝雅冷哼一声，将手中的资料袋扬起，同时右手之中的打火机呈现出来，‘啪嗒’一声，火机露出火苗，然然扩大。“我的身份是你们强加给我的，十三年你们剥夺了我的所有，如今是时候偿还了。”女子右手一点一点的移动，火苗燃烧在资料袋上。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/shenyiqifei/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "There is a mysterious race hidden in the dense forests in northern Asia. Yinyue is the most mysterious and ancient family in the world. No one knows what the Yinyue family does, and no one has seen their true appearance. Over time, this family is gradually forgotten, and the more forgotten something is, the more deadly it is. \"Whoosh\" There was a huge roar in the sky, and a helicopter flew in from a distance. At the same time, a black camouflage car rushed out of the guardrail. 'Boom!' The protective forest was rushed out a few meters away, and the camouflage car moved forward rapidly, heading straight into the mountain forest. \"Miss Lan, helicopter No. 7 is approaching this way.\" In the camouflage car, a man stretched out his head to look at the helicopter above, turned around and immediately said to the woman behind him. \"Go around the deep forest.\" The woman glanced upward through the car window, her eyes filled with hatred. \"Yes.\" Upon hearing this, the man driving in front immediately increased his speed. When he pressed the accelerator with his left hand, the entire camouflage car immediately changed. A layer of knife-like sequins was added to the periphery of the camouflage vehicle. The wheels of the running vehicle immediately became larger, and the speed in the dense forest became faster and more stable. The woman at the back was wearing black leather and black sunglasses. She was holding an information bag in her hand. She held the information bag slightly tightly with her fingers, and her pursed red lips could not help but tighten a bit. The moment this information was passed to her, she knew what to do. Maybe from today on, the Silver Moon family will no longer exist in this world... The Silver Moon family has a history of thousands of years. They have been doctors for generations and have superb medical skills. No doctor in the country can compare with them. However, their family rarely saves people, but harms them instead! \"Camouflage car No. 11, please stop quickly, please stop quickly.\" The helicopter above reached the top of the camouflage vehicle in a blink of an eye, and the huge wind impacted the camouflage vehicle running below. The man driving the car made a sharp turn, trying to take a detour to a hidden place and trying to escape from the helicopter. But the plane above them was slowly descending, and it seemed like if they didn't stop, the plane would fall on their car. \"Miss Lan, what should we do now?\" The man looked nervous. \"Stop the car.\" The woman took off her black sunglasses, revealing a pair of sharp eyes. With a small face as big as a palm and a pair of eyes, she is so beautiful that people dare not look directly at her. The car door opened, the woman got out of the car, looked up at the figure landing from the helicopter above, a glimmer of light flashed across her cold face, the information bag in her left hand was tightly held, and a lighter was hidden in the palm of her right hand. \"Lanya put down the information in your hands, maybe you can still live.\" The man who came down from above said in a persuasive tone. \"Can you live?\" Lan Ya smiled, as if she heard the funniest words: \"But, I never thought about living.\" Her life is worth the entire Silver Moon family! \"Lanya, don't forget your identity!\" The man seemed a little anxious when he heard this. He stared at the information bag in his hand and clenched his fists. Lanya snorted coldly and raised the information bag in her hand. At the same time, the lighter in her right hand appeared. With a 'click' sound, the lighter revealed flames and then expanded. \"My identity was forced on me by you. In the past thirteen years, you have deprived me of everything. Now it is time to repay.\" The woman's right hand moved little by little, and the flames burned on the information bag.", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}